                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Buggy! Just a few minutes in, and I've already seen quite a few bugs (falling through the ground, tons of clipping, poor swing mechanics). This game is definitely not ready to be sold (despite it being an early release) especially for $20!",
                        "timestamp_created": 1474318438,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1474318699,
                        "voted_up": false,
                        "votes_up": 18,
