                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": true,
                        "developer_response": "Thanks for the response. Any chance we could chat to see if we could get to the bottom of the issues you saw? I cannot reproduce the falling through the floor bug and would like to get some more information if possible. It's incredibly strange because the player does not have gravity or physics and cannot fall. You can test this by hitting a ball and then teleporting to it in mid air, you will just stay there. I'm wondering if we are having a communication issue which would make it impossible to find the source of the bug. Thanks!",
